5-a9b3-c98e008a72fd","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"linuxで市販のブルーレイ見る方法ってないのかなぁ","ts":"1621054888.374400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+BHbk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b559bfe9-0b5c-4bd9-b180-0ad3790f60e1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":kan::sha:","ts":"1621049548.372600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/BC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f58c558e-e2b9-4092-9bd5-7ef791f65b57","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CL6NCDCQG/p1621048968370900?thread_ts=1621048417.369900\u0026amp;cid=CL6NCDCQG\u003e\nこれに書いてあったことと足りなかったmetadata.jsonの記述を合わせたらいけました\n\u003chttps://rail.hatenablog.jp/entry/2012/12/10/122913\u003e","ts":"1621049539.372200","attachments":[{"fallback":"[May 14th, 2021 8:22 PM] sitamo: \u003chttps://wonwon-eater.com/manjaro-gnome-fcitx5/#outline__1_6_1\u003e\nぐぐると設定してる人がいる感","id":1,"author_id":"UQX22KG9F","author_name":"shitamo","author_subname":"shitamo","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/UQX22KG9F","author_icon":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/118f1b03058d7f96af658ebc4d75ec4f.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0011-48.png","text":"\u003chttps://wonwon-eater.com/manjaro-gnome-fcitx5/#outline__1_6_1\u003e\nぐぐると設定してる人がいる感","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"From a thread in #os-linux","ts":1621048968.370900,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CL6NCDCQG/p1621048968370900?thread_ts=1621048417.369900\u0026amp;cid=CL6NCDCQG","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CL6NCDCQG/p1621048968370900?thread_ts=1621048417.369900\u0026amp;cid=CL6NCDCQG"},{"fallback":"rail44 (アメミヤ): 日本語入力環境SKKを使う - rail44 (アメミヤ)","id":2,"title":"日本語入力環境SKKを使う - rail44 (アメミヤ)","title_link":"https://rail.hatenablog.jp/entry/2012/12/10/122913","text":"今まで、日本語入力にはibus-mozcを使っていたのですが、ふとSKKを使ってみたくなり早速チャレンジしてみました。 理に適っているのは分かるんですが、今までと全く違う入力方法に戸惑っています。なので、入力の練習も兼ねて環境の作成手順をブログに書くことにしました。 linuxの場合はibus用のモジュールがあるのでインストールは簡単。ibus-skkとかそういう名前のパッケージを入れれば大丈夫でした。 他のOSでも使う方法があるみたいなので……ググってください。 で、使ってみたんですが、！マークがひらがなモードの時も半角になってしまいます。 調べてみると、~/.config/ibus-skk…","image_url":"https://ogimage.blog.st-hatena.com/12704591929889016120/12704830469096323480/1425606373","blocks":null,"ts":1355110153,"service_name":"rail44 (アメミヤ)","service_icon":"https://rail.hatenablog.jp/icon/touch","from_url":"https://rail.hatenablog.jp/entry/2012/12/10/122913","original_url":"https://rail.hatenablog.jp/entry/2012/12/10/122913"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3yWx1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc081fe9-b4a7-476f-a2ae-6052eca8ad91","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"libskk側でできるみたいな話を聞いたのでやってみてる","ts":"1621048976.371300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+yb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8289bfa-e802-49d0-9af8-6507aafcf7eb","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"libskk自体は対応してるのでできる気はしますけど……","ts":"1621048470.370500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dc1YU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b9448e5-a384-4c94-a89b-3d3249f5ed04","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"fcitx5-skk使えるように設定したけどsticky shift使えないらしくて非常につらい","ts":"1621048417.369900","thread_ts":"1621048417.369900","reply_count":7,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GXV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0989c072-d1e8-4336-9005-3e6e92ef4b72","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"公式のリポジトリはデータベースには署名されていないのでdb.sigは無いそうですね","ts":"1621040002.369300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j16=v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9240bf43-5f2